<title>USA: TABLE - Tandy Corp sells $150 mln notes.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Tandy Corp sells $150 mln notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Tandy Corp was priced on Thursday, according to lead manager Bear Stearns &amp; Co Inc.</p>
<p>Tandy Corp is a major consumer electronics retailer.</p>
<p>BORROWER TANDY CORP</p>
<p>AMT $150 MLN	 COUPON 6.95 PCT   MATURITY 9/1/2007</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.611  FIRST PAY DATE 3/1/1998</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BAA2  YIELD 7.004 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P A-MINUS   SPREAD +73 BPS    CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>((Caryn Trokie, U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1678))</p>
